{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54007","headline":"十二时歌 十二 · 从谂","name":"十二时歌 十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"半夜子，心境何曾得暂止。\n思量天下出家人，似我住持能有几？\n土榻牀，破芦蕟{下爲废}，老榆木枕全无被。\n尊香不烧安息香，灰里唯闻牛粪气。\n（此组诗又见《禅门诸祖师偈颂》卷上之下）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"从谂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54007.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54007","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}